OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opened after man killed
OL,4,Awhile crossing road
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest into the death of a man who
OL,7,Fdied in a fatal collision has opened
OL,8,Fand been adjourned by a coroner.
OL,10,FStephen Allen, 64, was on his routine
OL,11,Fmorning walk when he was struck on Bath
OL,12,FRoad in Reading, near the Lidl
OL,13,Fsupermarket, at about 06:30 GMT on 26
OL,14,FNovember 2025.
OL,16,FSenior coroner for Berkshire Heidi
OL,17,FConnor told the inquest that a
OL,18,Fpost-mortem examination found Allen
OL,19,Fdied from pelvic and limb trauma.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
