OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opened after man killed
OL,4,Awhile crossing road
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe adjourned the hearing at Reading
OL,7,FCoroner's Court for criminal
OL,8,Fprosecutions to continue. A pre-inquest
OL,9,Freview hearing is scheduled to take
OL,10,Fplace there on 9 February 2027.
